flowchart TD
    A["Unprotected intercourse"] --> B{"Days since?"}
    B -->|"6–7 days"| C["Copper intrauterine device ONLY<br/>MOST effective, and she leaves with ongoing contraception"]
    B -->|"Within 5 days"| D{"Copper intrauterine device acceptable and available?"}
    D -->|Yes| C
    D -->|No| E{"Has the luteinizing hormone rise begun?"}
    E -->|"Not yet, or unsure"| F["Levonorgestrel 1.5 mg<br/>best under 72 h"]
    E -->|"Already rising"| G["Ulipristal 30 mg<br/>still works DURING the rise"]
    F --> H["Yuzpe regimen only if nothing else is available<br/>LEAST effective"]

flowchart TD
 A["Acute pelvic pain"] --> B["Check vitals FIRST — is she stable?"]
 B --> C{"Quantitative beta-hCG"}
 C -->|"POSITIVE"| D{"Signs of rupture?<br/>shoulder pain, tenesmus,<br/>postural drop, falling haemoglobin (Hb)"}
 D -->|Yes| E["RUPTURED ECTOPIC<br/>to the operating room"]
 D -->|No| F["Transvaginal ultrasound — an intrauterine<br/>pregnancy should be seen<br/>above a beta-hCG of 1500"]
 C -->|"NEGATIVE"| G{"Fever and elevated white<br/>blood cell count (WBC)?"}
 G -->|Yes| H["Pelvic inflammatory disease —<br/>chandelier sign,<br/>discharge, dyspareunia"]
 G -->|No| I{"Sudden onset with an adnexal mass?"}
 I -->|"After exertion, Hb stable"| J["OVARIAN TORSION<br/>surgical emergency"]
 I -->|"Falling Hb, 2-3 weeks from<br/>last menstrual period"| K["RUPTURED OVARIAN CYST<br/>with haemorrhage"]

flowchart TD
 A["Pregnancy"] --> B{"Screen or diagnose?"}
 B -->|"SCREEN — gives a risk"| C["Nuchal translucency (NT) ultrasound 11-13 w<br/>Enhanced first trimester screen (eFTS) 11-13 w<br/>Maternal serum screen (MSS) 16-20 w<br/>Non-invasive prenatal testing (NIPT) from 9 w"]
 B -->|"DIAGNOSE — gives an answer"| D["Chorionic villus sampling (CVS) 11-13 w<br/>Amniocentesis 15-20 w"]
 C --> E{"Screen positive?"}
 E -->|Yes| F["A positive SCREEN still<br/>needs a DIAGNOSTIC test"]
 F --> D
 D --> G{"Which test, by size of abnormality?"}
 G --> H["Karyotype over 5 megabases<br/>Microarray about 3 megabases<br/>Polymerase chain reaction, multiplex ligation-dependent probe amplification, sequencing 10 kilobases to 1 kilobase<br/>Single gene 1 base pair"]

flowchart TD
    A["Amenorrhea"] --> B{"beta-hCG"}
    B -->|POSITIVE| C["PREGNANCY — exclude first, every time"]
    B -->|NEGATIVE| D{"Uterus present?"}
    D -->|"NO — and pubarche"| E["Mayer-Rokitansky-Kuster-Hauser syndrome (MRKH), 46,XX"]
    D -->|"NO — no pubarche"| F["Androgen insensitivity, 46,XY"]
    D -->|Yes| G{"Prolactin, thyroid-stimulating hormone (TSH)"}
    G -->|Abnormal| H["Prolactinoma or drug · hypothyroidism"]
    G -->|Normal| I{"serum FSH"}
    I -->|HIGH| J["OVARIAN — karyotype:<br/>abnormal = Turner, normal = primary ovarian insufficiency"]
    I -->|LOW| K["HYPOTHALAMIC / PITUITARY — functional first,<br/>MRI only if no stressor"]
    I -->|NORMAL| L["ANOVULATION — androgens:<br/>polycystic ovarian syndrome (PCOS), tumour,<br/>late-onset congenital adrenal hyperplasia"]

flowchart TD
    A["53-year-old with menopause concerns"] --> B["History: menses, symptoms,<br/>contraindications to menopausal hormone therapy (MHT)"]
    B --> C{"Which symptom?"}
    C -->|"GSM"| D["Lifestyle, lubricants, moisturizers, physiotherapy<br/>2nd line: vaginal estrogen, dehydroepiandrosterone, ospemifene"]
    C -->|"VMS"| E{"Contraindication to estrogen?"}
    E -->|Yes| F["Non-hormonal: antidepressants, gabapentinoids,<br/>neurokinin 3 receptor antagonists,<br/>cognitive behavioural therapy, cooling"]
    E -->|No| G{"Younger than 60 and<br/>< 10 years post menopause?"}
    G -->|"No"| F2["Outside the deck's safe-start window<br/>weigh risk; non-hormonal options"]
    G -->|Yes| H{"Does she have a uterus?"}
    H -->|Yes| I["Estrogen + progesterone<br/>(progestin pill or levonorgestrel<br/>intrauterine device)"]
    H -->|"No - hysterectomy"| J["Estrogen alone"]

flowchart TD
    A["Ovarian mass on exam / imaging"] --> B{"Age?"}
    B -->|"Young (0-25)"| C["Germ cell lineage likely<br/>Send serum markers: alpha-fetoprotein (α-FP),<br/>lactate dehydrogenase (LDH),<br/>beta human chorionic gonadotropin (β-hCG)"]
    B -->|"Adult / post-menopausal"| D["Epithelial lineage likely<br/>Cancer more likely after menopause"]
    D --> E{"Bilateral, multi-nodular?"}
    E -->|Yes| F["Think METASTASIS<br/>gastrointestinal (appendix, stomach, colon), pancreatobiliary, breast, endometrium"]
    E -->|No| G["Primary epithelial tumour<br/>Behaviour set by invasion: benign / borderline / carcinoma"]
    A --> H{"Endocrine features?"}
    H -->|"Estrogenic: abnormal uterine bleeding, endometrial hyperplasia / cancer"| I["Granulosa cell tumour"]

flowchart TD
    A["Breast lump<br/>History + breast exam + axilla and nodes"] --> B{"Post-menopausal<br/>or high risk?"}
    B -->|Yes| INV["INVESTIGATE NOW"]
    B -->|"No - pre-menopausal"| C{"History and exam benign?"}
    C -->|No| INV
    C -->|Yes| D["Re-examine after the next menstrual cycle"]
    D --> E{"Resolved?"}
    E -->|Yes| F["Follow"]
    E -->|No| INV
    INV --> G{"Age?"}
    G -->|"< 35"| H["ULTRASOUND first<br/>MRI if high risk"]
    G -->|"> 35"| I["MAMMOGRAM first +/- ultrasound (US)"]

flowchart TD
    A["Positive hCG ± bleeding or pain<br/>Hemodynamically stable"] --> B["Transvaginal ultrasound of uterus + adnexa<br/>(± transabdominal for high mass / free fluid)"]
    B --> C{"Intrauterine pregnancy (IUP) seen?"}
    C -->|Yes| D["Date it by the landmark present:<br/>mean sac diameter (MSD) → crown-rump length (CRL) → biparietal diameter (BPD)"]
    C -->|"No: pregnancy of unknown location (PUL)"| E{"hCG 2000-3000 mIU and<br/>no clear evidence of ectopic?"}
    E -->|Yes| F["REPEAT hCG ± ultrasound a few days later<br/>2x more likely non-viable IUP (NVIUP) than ectopic; 0.5-2% viable IUP"]
    F --> G{"What does the serial hCG do?"}
    G -->|"Rises past 3000 (~3500), still no IUP"| H["ECTOPIC LIKELY"]
    G -->|"Falls 15-50% per 24 h"| I["Likely NVIUP: follow until < 5 mIU/mL"]
    G -->|"Decline off the predictable curve"| J["Re-evaluate: incomplete abortion<br/>or non-resolving ectopic"]

flowchart TD
    A["BP >140/90 on 2 readings >15 min apart"] --> B{"Onset before or after 20 weeks?"}
    B -->|"Before pregnancy or <20 weeks"| C["PRE-EXISTING (chronic) hypertension"]
    B -->|">20 weeks, normal BPs documented before"| D{"Proteinuria or adverse conditions?"}
    D -->|No| E["GESTATIONAL hypertension<br/>isolated BP elevation"]
    D -->|Yes| F["PRE-ECLAMPSIA<br/>hypertension + proteinuria"]
    F -->|"Seizure"| G["ECLAMPSIA"]
    F -.->|"Hemolysis + high liver enzymes + low platelets<br/>BP may be NORMAL"| H["HELLP syndrome"]
    A --> I{"Systolic BP >160 or diastolic BP >110?"}
    I -->|Yes| J["SEVERE - urgent intravenous (IV) lowering to <160/<110"]

flowchart TD
    A["2nd/3rd trimester vaginal bleeding"] --> B["Airway, breathing, circulation for mom: oxygen + intravenous access if unstable<br/>Non-stress test for the fetus: baseline, accelerations, decelerations"]
    B --> C{"Non-obstetrical source?<br/>hemorrhoids/varices, bladder infection/renal stones, masses, lacerations"}
    C -->|Yes| D["Treat the cause, as in a non-pregnant patient"]
    C -->|No| E{"Labour?<br/>cervical dilatation frequently causes bleeding/show"}
    E -->|No| F{"Painful, with a tender or rigid uterus?"}
    F -->|Yes| G["PLACENTAL ABRUPTION<br/>a diagnosis of exclusion"]
    F -->|"No - painless"| H{"Ultrasound: placenta over, or within 2 cm of, the internal os?"}
    H -->|Yes| I["PLACENTA PREVIA<br/>complete = cesarean section (C/S); no cervical exam"]
    H -->|"No, but fetal distress out of keeping with the volume"| J["Apt test positive = fetal blood<br/>VASA PREVIA"]

flowchart TD
    A["Contractions before 37 weeks<br/>(threatened preterm labour)"] --> B{"Cervical dilatation on exam?"}
    B -->|No| C["Threatened preterm labour (TPTL) - hydrate, treat urinary tract infection (UTI)<br/>may resolve without delivery"]
    B -->|Yes| D["Preterm labour - tocolysis<br/>+ antenatal corticosteroids if < 34 weeks<br/>with or without transfer to tertiary centre"]
    A --> E{"Gush of fluid?<br/>pooling / nitrazine / ferning / low amniotic fluid index"}
    E -->|Yes| F["Preterm prelabour rupture of membranes (PPROM) - antibiotics for latency<br/>complete steroid course<br/>watch for chorioamnionitis"]
    D --> G{"Birth imminent?"}
    F --> G
    G -->|"Yes, < 34 weeks"| H["Magnesium sulfate intravenous (IV) bolus + infusion (neuroprotection)<br/>+ IV penicillin if group B streptococcus (GBS) positive or unknown"]

flowchart TD
    A["Postpartum patient<br/>Patient Health Questionnaire-2 (PHQ-2)<br/>on the antenatal record"] --> B{"PHQ-2 total ≥ 3?"}
    B -->|No| C["Routine postnatal care"]
    B -->|Yes| D["Edinburgh Postnatal Depression Scale (EPDS)<br/>or Patient Health Questionnaire-9 (PHQ-9)<br/>or further mental health follow-up"]
    D --> E{"EPDS item 10 scored 1-3?"}
    E -->|Yes| F["RISK OF SELF-HARM<br/>immediate mental health assessment + intervention"]
    E -->|No| G{"EPDS total?"}
    G -->|"> 12"| H["Comprehensive bio-psychosocial<br/>diagnostic assessment for depression"]
    G -->|"> 9, not > 12"| I["Monitor, support, offer education"]
